Bundled terminal fonts

The WOFF2 files in this directory are Nerd Font Mono variants. Their original
font licenses and copyright notices are retained in the licenses/ directory:

- Caskaydia Cove: licenses/CaskaydiaCove-OFL-1.1.txt
- Fira Code: licenses/FiraCode-OFL-1.1.txt
- Hack: licenses/Hack-MIT-Bitstream.txt
- Iosevka: licenses/Iosevka-OFL-1.1.txt
- JetBrains Mono: licenses/JetBrainsMono-OFL-1.1.txt
- Nerd Fonts patching and bundled glyph sources: licenses/NerdFonts-LICENSE.txt

Source project: https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts

These assets remain under their respective licenses and are not relicensed
under TGent's AGPL license.
